{"about_the_game":"Possession Obsession is a 2-4 player local multiplayer party game. As interns, you and your friends will compete for a coveted position at the infamous HELLC. Utilize your demonic powers and possess mortals to complete the boss's tasks in any way possible.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MOUNDS OF MORTALS TO POSSESS!</strong></h2>Possess mortals at any time! Gain special abilities from whomever you possess to help you complete the HELLC's tasks and impede the progress of your fellow interns. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838030/extras/NPCShowcase2.gif?t=1658517457\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>4 DIFFERENT DEMONIC CLASSES</strong></h2>Make use of 4 unique classes to crush the competition. Each class has access to 2 abilities in demon form and another when possession a mortal. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838030/extras/JoinScreenClassesFinal.gif?t=1658517457\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FRIENDSHIP RUINING TASKS TO FIGHT OVER!</strong></h2>Fight over the many tasks the HELLC assigns to be the intern that gets the job!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838030/extras/TasksGif3.gif?t=1658517457\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1838030?t=1658517457","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1838030?t=1658517457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1658517457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1658517457","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Pa